<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan cut by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan cut by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Freeport-McMoRan Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate and to long-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Tuesday at 35.</p>
</text>
